Local, played by Dominic Kay.

15
01:05:31,578 --> 01:05:37,578
White Settlers (also released as The Blood Lands) is a 2014 British
thriller-horror film that was directed by Simeon Halligan.

16
01:09:53,684 --> 01:09:59,684
The film had its  premiere on 23 August 2014 at Film4 FrightFest and stars Pollyanna McIntosh and Lee
Williams as a couple that find that their new home is not as hospitable as they would have hoped.

17
01:14:15,789 --> 01:14:21,789
The film explores themes of farm, mask, pig, scotland, knife.

18
01:18:37,894 --> 01:18:43,894
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
